[00:00.403]
[00:22.536]I remember when the bartender said, "It's on the house"
{"我记得酒保说过「这杯我请」"}}
[00:26.275]You make me wanna fall in love
{"你让我渴望坠入爱河"}
[00:28.362]The weather felt better
{"连天气都变得明媚"}
[00:30.917]When we were in it together
{"当我们共同沐浴其中时"}
[00:33.519]I miss the way
{"我怀念那种方式"}
[00:37.135]We used to talk about nothin'
{"我们曾漫无边际地闲聊"}
[00:39.109]I hate to say
{"我实在不愿承认"}
[00:42.667]I should've seen it comin'
{"早该预见这结局"}
[00:44.914]Last summer, everything was easy
{"去年夏天一切都那么简单"}
[00:48.227]We had it all, didn't we, baby?
{"我们曾拥有全部 不是吗 亲爱的"}
[00:50.451]No wonder you couldn't keep me
{"难怪你终究留不住我"}
[00:53.738]It got harder than you thought it would be
{"这比预想的艰难许多"}
[00:56.181]You stopped lovin' me on the dark nights
{"你在黑夜中止息了爱意"}
[00:58.827]Now you won't kiss me in the sunlight
{"如今白昼里也不愿吻我"}
[01:01.494]Last summer, I knew you'd leave me
{"去年夏天就预知你会离去"}
